From 828678a1f6384675133e28db643c3bb9e43c3666 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Rob Herring (Arm)" <robh@kernel.org>
Date: Wed, 5 Mar 2025 16:49:52 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 0136/0797] arm64: dts: nvidia: Remove unused and undocumented "regulator-ramp-delay-scale" property

Remove "regulator-ramp-delay-scale" property which is both unused in the
kernel and undocumented. Most likely they are leftovers from downstream.

Signed-off-by: Rob Herring (Arm) <robh@kernel.org>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20250305224952.2995841-2-robh@kernel.org
Signed-off-by: Arnd Bergmann <arnd@arndb.de>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra210-p3450-0000.dts | 10 ----------
 1 file changed, 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra210-p3450-0000.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra210-p3450-0000.dts
index c56824d7f4d834..0ecdd7243b2eb1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/tegra210-p3450-0000.dts
